CORE
smv1.smv
--bound 5 --coi --verbosity 9
^Cone of influence: 1 of 2 state variables, 5 of 8 constraints \(invar 1/1, init 1/2, trans 3/5\)$
^\[spec1\] AG \(x = 0 \| x != 0\): PROVED up to bound 5$
^\[spec2\] AG !\(z & x != 3\): PROVED up to bound 5$
^\[spec3\] AG x != 4: REFUTED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
